(2578451, 357287, 24073, '<td valign="top">Its always dangerous for me to enter photos of my kids, because I always tend to think the photo is better than it actually is.  Of course I don''t know if this is your baby or not, but at any rate the same rule must not apply for you, because this photo is stunning. Simply gorgeous, and you done a fantastic job at capturing it.  I like it 100 %!</td>', 'Its always dangerous for me to enter photos of my kids, because I always tend to think the photo is better than it actually is.  Of course I don''t know if this is your baby or not, but at any rate the same rule must not apply for you, because this photo is stunning. Simply gorgeous, and you done a fantastic job at capturing it.  I like it 100 %!', '2006-07-03 10:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
