(2579058, 356594, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  I would have liked the composition to put the caterpillar somewhere off-center, but the rich colors and sharpness are very good!  Nice image - good luck!</td>', 'Nice capture!  I would have liked the composition to put the caterpillar somewhere off-center, but the rich colors and sharpness are very good!  Nice image - good luck!', '2006-07-03 13:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
