(2579094, 356170, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  That is totally cool!  Wonderful exposure on the flames - not an easy thing to do.  Very cool image - hope it''s scoring well!</td>', 'Great capture!  That is totally cool!  Wonderful exposure on the flames - not an easy thing to do.  Very cool image - hope it''s scoring well!', '2006-07-03 13:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
