(2579217, 356580, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a cute girl with a sweet smile. The composition works but her skin tones look a bit flat to me. It looks a bit overexposed judging by the loss of textural detail in her shirt.</td>', 'This is a cute girl with a sweet smile. The composition works but her skin tones look a bit flat to me. It looks a bit overexposed judging by the loss of textural detail in her shirt.', '2006-07-03 14:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
