(2579221, 356168, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the sharpest focus on the bee. Nice simple composition though.</td>', 'I''d like to see the sharpest focus on the bee. Nice simple composition though.', '2006-07-03 14:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2579225, 357306, 7322, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting subject. I feel like a different point of view should have been tried---something that would place the main subject in front of a less busy background. The spikyness of the main subject is competing with stalkiness of the background.</td>', 'It''s an interesting subject. I feel like a different point of view should have been tried---something that would place the main subject in front of a less busy background. The spikyness of the main subject is competing with stalkiness of the background.', '2006-07-03 14:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2579239, 356958, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this was the best choice of subject for a challenge like this. I''m sure this is a delicious dish but this close-up shot doesn''t make for a particularly appealing photo.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this was the best choice of subject for a challenge like this. I''m sure this is a delicious dish but this close-up shot doesn''t make for a particularly appealing photo.', '2006-07-03 14:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
