(2579255, 357361, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an nice view but the image quality isn''t quite there for me. It looks a bit fuzzy and washed out to me. I''d like to see the colors on the train and the blue of the water really pop.</td>', 'This is an nice view but the image quality isn''t quite there for me. It looks a bit fuzzy and washed out to me. I''d like to see the colors on the train and the blue of the water really pop.', '2006-07-03 14:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
