(2583528, 356924, 55956, '<td valign="top">I think that the idea is good but the shot isn''t good. the white poles on the background are distracting. I think that if you move the ball far away the poles and a better position of the ball in the frame here to have a very good image. there is even a small over exposure on the left of the ball. I rate 4.<br/>Best regards</td>', 'I think that the idea is good but the shot isn''t good. the white poles on the background are distracting. I think that if you move the ball far away the poles and a better position of the ball in the frame here to have a very good image. there is even a small over exposure on the left of the ball. I rate 4.Best regards', '2006-07-04 11:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
