(2584489, 357042, 52336, '<td valign="top">Why indeed.  Technically and, in "execution", a good photo, but otherwise nauseating and disturbing, not a combination that personally works for me.</td>', 'Why indeed.  Technically and, in "execution", a good photo, but otherwise nauseating and disturbing, not a combination that personally works for me.', '2006-07-04 15:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584498, 356152, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait, with an interesting (risky) framing choice.  The way it highlights Jon''s eyes, and thus his almost sublime expression, makes it a risk worth taking in my opinion.  The vital element here is lighting, and without the processing option, better exposure is called for, though the composition of the lighting is pretty much perfect.  Great portrait, 8.</td>', 'This is a great portrait, with an interesting (risky) framing choice.  The way it highlights Jon''s eyes, and thus his almost sublime expression, makes it a risk worth taking in my opinion.  The vital element here is lighting, and without the processing option, better exposure is called for, though the composition of the lighting is pretty much perfect.  Great portrait, 8.', '2006-07-04 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2584502, 356022, 52336, '<td valign="top">Great colour and clarity, and an extra point for the title. :)</td>', 'Great colour and clarity, and an extra point for the title. :)', '2006-07-04 16:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
