(2588290, 356737, 56828, '<td valign="top">First there is the obvious rotation, but that is more of a camera orientation.  It makes it harder to view the photo though.  I notice that the church itself is out of focus.  It was a good capture of the moon over the Cathedral though.  you found the moon in a perfect spot.</td>', 'First there is the obvious rotation, but that is more of a camera orientation.  It makes it harder to view the photo though.  I notice that the church itself is out of focus.  It was a good capture of the moon over the Cathedral though.  you found the moon in a perfect spot.', '2006-07-05 15:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
