(2588737, 357304, 56828, '<td valign="top">This photo would have been better if you oculd have gotten a different angle.  Maybe one showing her face and/or where she is jumping from.  There is too much wasted space in the top of the photo, that could have been used to capture more of the pool.  Placing her near the top right corner would have given the photo more effect by showing more of the pool and giving more of a sense of depth.</td>', 'This photo would have been better if you oculd have gotten a different angle.  Maybe one showing her face and/or where she is jumping from.  There is too much wasted space in the top of the photo, that could have been used to capture more of the pool.  Placing her near the top right corner would have given the photo more effect by showing more of the pool and giving more of a sense of depth.', '2006-07-05 17:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588739, 356828, 45826, '<td valign="top">Nice ppicture. I think it would have been really good if you would have pulled in tighter and only had the flower and butterfly without all of the other background.</td>', 'Nice ppicture. I think it would have been really good if you would have pulled in tighter and only had the flower and butterfly without all of the other background.', '2006-07-05 17:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588744, 356894, 56828, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you were gonig for more artistic here?  Seems like its just a little too busy with no clear idea of what you were aiming for.</td>', 'I''m assuming you were gonig for more artistic here?  Seems like its just a little too busy with no clear idea of what you were aiming for.', '2006-07-05 17:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588747, 356095, 56828, '<td valign="top">The background subject is too blurry.  Your foreground subject has great focus but not enough of it is captured to know what it is.</td>', 'The background subject is too blurry.  Your foreground subject has great focus but not enough of it is captured to know what it is.', '2006-07-05 17:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588775, 357337, 56828, '<td valign="top">The extra red lines take way from the photo. Because he is swinging into it( and it''s right in the center of the photo), your focus is brought to the extra swing.  I''m bumping it up 1 point though.</td>', 'The extra red lines take way from the photo. Because he is swinging into it( and it''s right in the center of the photo), your focus is brought to the extra swing.  I''m bumping it up 1 point though.', '2006-07-05 17:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588786, 357229, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the blue tone...I''m giving you an extra point on this one.</td>', 'I like the blue tone...I''m giving you an extra point on this one.', '2006-07-05 17:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588799, 356276, 56828, '<td valign="top">The boy is too red.  And I''m not a big fan of huge shadow across his chest.</td>', 'The boy is too red.  And I''m not a big fan of huge shadow across his chest.', '2006-07-05 17:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2588816, 357364, 56828, '<td valign="top">lacks focus.  I do like the idea of the water looking like jets of light.  The girl in the background takes away from the photo. Too much negative space on teh right side.</td>', 'lacks focus.  I do like the idea of the water looking like jets of light.  The girl in the background takes away from the photo. Too much negative space on teh right side.', '2006-07-05 17:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589246, 357292, 42567, '<td valign="top">My fav of the challenge!  I hope you ribbon!</td>', 'My fav of the challenge!  I hope you ribbon!', '2006-07-05 18:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589264, 356806, 60195, '<td valign="top">very nice shot.  the angle is perfect - i feel like i''m flying right behind the thing! my pick for the winner. 9  :O)</td>', 'very nice shot.  the angle is perfect - i feel like i''m flying right behind the thing! my pick for the winner. 9  :O)', '2006-07-05 18:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589298, 357128, 12578, '<td valign="top">Wow those eyes are just fantastic and big - be hard not to focus on these little gems huh ! My only vice to this shot is the harsh light on the childs fringe and just under the hands on the wood, never the less a beautiful shot... GL 8</td>', 'Wow those eyes are just fantastic and big - be hard not to focus on these little gems huh ! My only vice to this shot is the harsh light on the childs fringe and just under the hands on the wood, never the less a beautiful shot... GL 8', '2006-07-05 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589302, 357336, 12578, '<td valign="top">Simple - Effective - Vibrant - GL</td>', 'Simple - Effective - Vibrant - GL', '2006-07-05 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589312, 356962, 12578, '<td valign="top">would like to see a little more saturation in this shot but the nature of the challenge i''ll forgive ya! love the centring of the shot, the only one thing that would possibly improve this is to slow this down with a ND filter over the lens to give a slow 1/2 - 2 second shutter speed for smooth flowing water (this would then have huge appeal to the product your promoting, i.e. stating that its relaxing, cool, calm and easy), good luck and my fave so far... 9</td>', 'would like to see a little more saturation in this shot but the nature of the challenge i''ll forgive ya! love the centring of the shot, the only one thing that would possibly improve this is to slow this down with a ND filter over the lens to give a slow 1/2 - 2 second shutter speed for smooth flowing water (this would then have huge appeal to the product your promoting, i.e. stating that its relaxing, cool, calm and easy), good luck and my fave so far... 9', '2006-07-05 18:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589323, 356944, 12578, '<td valign="top">slightly dark at the top in the trees and would prefer a little more saturation but not allowed in the challenge - ok... the rest of the shot and the way you have gone about doing it is great apart from the fact that there is little to no overall focal point as its spread accross the entire center.</td>', 'slightly dark at the top in the trees and would prefer a little more saturation but not allowed in the challenge - ok... the rest of the shot and the way you have gone about doing it is great apart from the fact that there is little to no overall focal point as its spread accross the entire center.', '2006-07-05 18:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589329, 356067, 12578, '<td valign="top">With the animal not looking at you it would be nice to see some extra space and see its surroundings</td>', 'With the animal not looking at you it would be nice to see some extra space and see its surroundings', '2006-07-05 18:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589351, 356238, 12578, '<td valign="top">Got myself a shot of one of these today myself, would have possibly been catching a duck for dinner - shame it was spoint when two people blew my cover in the woods and it looked right at me. Also spoilt by the fact your shot straight from camera is better than what i ended up with... Great job - next time if there is one try to get a little lower if possible and see if it makes any improvement. 8</td>', 'Got myself a shot of one of these today myself, would have possibly been catching a duck for dinner - shame it was spoint when two people blew my cover in the woods and it looked right at me. Also spoilt by the fact your shot straight from camera is better than what i ended up with... Great job - next time if there is one try to get a little lower if possible and see if it makes any improvement. 8', '2006-07-05 18:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589360, 355956, 12578, '<td valign="top">Hope you''ve been saving those corks and didn''t just waste the entire cellar... !!! Fantastic straight from camera shot but if i were picky would like to see a little more definition on the top left of the glass. 9</td>', 'Hope you''ve been saving those corks and didn''t just waste the entire cellar... !!! Fantastic straight from camera shot but if i were picky would like to see a little more definition on the top left of the glass. 9', '2006-07-05 18:42:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2589362, 356456, 61030, '<td valign="top">Serene</td>', 'Serene', '2006-07-05 18:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589377, 357279, 12578, '<td valign="top">Good capture apart from the surfer being a little underexposed imho. Apart from that the linign up in hte viewfinder could be improved as the surfer is neither in the middle of the image nor on a third and the horizon is off. OK im picky but good job anyhow 7</td>', 'Good capture apart from the surfer being a little underexposed imho. Apart from that the linign up in hte viewfinder could be improved as the surfer is neither in the middle of the image nor on a third and the horizon is off. OK im picky but good job anyhow 7', '2006-07-05 18:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589392, 356000, 60195, '<td valign="top">nice use of your ordinary kitchen items to create a great shot!  Wanna help with my backyard ?  ;o)  well done. 8</td>', 'nice use of your ordinary kitchen items to create a great shot!  Wanna help with my backyard ?  ;o)  well done. 8', '2006-07-05 18:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589395, 356733, 12578, '<td valign="top">Could have been improved with having no gap at the top left, i.e. would like it to be all cars and no gap. I do very much like this shot though - I wonder if the straight from camera made you think more about the shot before pressing the shutter release button? 9</td>', 'Could have been improved with having no gap at the top left, i.e. would like it to be all cars and no gap. I do very much like this shot though - I wonder if the straight from camera made you think more about the shot before pressing the shutter release button? 9', '2006-07-05 18:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589400, 356093, 12578, '<td valign="top">simple and great - 8</td>', 'simple and great - 8', '2006-07-05 18:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589404, 357020, 12578, '<td valign="top">a little underexposed but a great shot.</td>', 'a little underexposed but a great shot.', '2006-07-05 18:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589411, 356725, 12578, '<td valign="top">good use of DOF, more light on the handle of the mower would have helped yet possibly the best mower shot ive seen to date...</td>', 'good use of DOF, more light on the handle of the mower would have helped yet possibly the best mower shot ive seen to date...', '2006-07-05 18:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589419, 357251, 12578, '<td valign="top">the horizon is not level but I love the shot. 8</td>', 'the horizon is not level but I love the shot. 8', '2006-07-05 18:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589426, 356925, 34082, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture with the reflection on the floor and the special perspective... but I think it''s a little bit too small</td>', 'A beautiful picture with the reflection on the floor and the special perspective... but I think it''s a little bit too small', '2006-07-05 18:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589427, 356737, 12578, '<td valign="top">Pretty sure you would have been allowed to rotate the shot as it would not impede the rules in any way. A longer shutter speed would have allowed the moon to give some light to the foliage infront of the church too.</td>', 'Pretty sure you would have been allowed to rotate the shot as it would not impede the rules in any way. A longer shutter speed would have allowed the moon to give some light to the foliage infront of the church too.', '2006-07-05 18:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589450, 357042, 12578, '<td valign="top">Disturbing - Yet I feel happy to see this after clicking mundane numbers on peoples ruddy pets and flowers... Good job and a well deserved 9</td>', 'Disturbing - Yet I feel happy to see this after clicking mundane numbers on peoples ruddy pets and flowers... Good job and a well deserved 9', '2006-07-05 18:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589525, 356666, 60195, '<td valign="top">Great crisp shot.  Wonderful pose with an extremely beautiful model. You get an 8 (she get''s a 10).  ;o)</td>', 'Great crisp shot.  Wonderful pose with an extremely beautiful model. You get an 8 (she get''s a 10).  ;o)', '2006-07-05 19:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589743, 356293, 12578, '<td valign="top">horizon could be more level</td>', 'horizon could be more level', '2006-07-05 19:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589747, 357080, 60195, '<td valign="top">nice shot! amazing how the ''simple'' things can produce unexpected results.</td>', 'nice shot! amazing how the ''simple'' things can produce unexpected results.', '2006-07-05 19:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589748, 356878, 12578, '<td valign="top">unable to define a clear point of focus?</td>', 'unable to define a clear point of focus?', '2006-07-05 19:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589755, 356232, 60195, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot... great setup, clarity &amp; overall feel. 9</td>', 'Awesome shot... great setup, clarity & overall feel. 9', '2006-07-05 19:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589760, 357266, 60195, '<td valign="top">Amazing color &amp; clarity. Beautiful shot... should do EXTREMELY well! Upping to a 9</td>', 'Amazing color & clarity. Beautiful shot... should do EXTREMELY well! Upping to a 9', '2006-07-05 19:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589763, 357205, 45826, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to get picture of those, at least where I live. They are pretty wary of people. Nice Job.</td>', 'It''s hard to get picture of those, at least where I live. They are pretty wary of people. Nice Job.', '2006-07-05 19:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589783, 356794, 45826, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2006-07-05 19:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589800, 357020, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very good.  Don''t get a shot like this too often.  Reflection, ripple capture, composition, colors, ''elements'', all very good.  If the focus on the eyes/head was as sharp as seems to be on the body, make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a more refined crop top right and <i>maybe</i> a nudge rotate up on the left for overall ''perspective balance'', may also have made this even better, not sure - however a moot point for this Challenge.  In my opinion, this Challenge is a test of the skill and eye of the photographer, and this shot shows you have both.  Classic shot.</td>', '9 - Very good.  Don''t get a shot like this too often.  Reflection, ripple capture, composition, colors, ''elements'', all very good.  If the focus on the eyes/head was as sharp as seems to be on the body, make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a more refined crop top right and maybe a nudge rotate up on the left for overall ''perspective balance'', may also have made this even better, not sure - however a moot point for this Challenge.  In my opinion, this Challenge is a test of the skill and eye of the photographer, and this shot shows you have both.  Classic shot.', '2006-07-05 20:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589817, 356925, 3735, '<td valign="top">try croping or sizing 640 x 427<br/>I have never seen a winner cut down this small <br/>looks interesting 5</td>', 'try croping or sizing 640 x 427I have never seen a winner cut down this small looks interesting 5', '2006-07-05 20:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589825, 356369, 3735, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2006-07-05 20:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589836, 356248, 3735, '<td valign="top">It could be a horse if he had ears  lol  6</td>', 'It could be a horse if he had ears  lol  6', '2006-07-05 20:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589843, 356116, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very good.  Good use of the infrared(?).  Whilst I''d prefer to see ''classic photography'' (ie: no in-camera effects, etc) for this Challenge, it is a sign of the technology and I accept that.  However there is a ''line'' on what in-camera editing supersedes the skills of the photographer.  Using this effect however doesn''t apply in my opinion.  A good eye and skill are required to produce an image like this.  The dof is spot-on, the only aspect I''d like to see improved upon is the overall ''depth'', as in ''dramatic feel'', if that makes sense.  Perhaps a little darker in areas, more definition, not sure.  I''m guessing a ''novice DPCer'' requested validation on this (and many others in this Challenge), which seems to be an issue that may need addressing someday.  Took the liberty of adding to my Favorites.  Like your title.</td>', '9 - Very good.  Good use of the infrared(?).  Whilst I''d prefer to see ''classic photography'' (ie: no in-camera effects, etc) for this Challenge, it is a sign of the technology and I accept that.  However there is a ''line'' on what in-camera editing supersedes the skills of the photographer.  Using this effect however doesn''t apply in my opinion.  A good eye and skill are required to produce an image like this.  The dof is spot-on, the only aspect I''d like to see improved upon is the overall ''depth'', as in ''dramatic feel'', if that makes sense.  Perhaps a little darker in areas, more definition, not sure.  I''m guessing a ''novice DPCer'' requested validation on this (and many others in this Challenge), which seems to be an issue that may need addressing someday.  Took the liberty of adding to my Favorites.  Like your title.', '2006-07-05 20:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589847, 357066, 3735, '<td valign="top">love this 9</td>', 'love this 9', '2006-07-05 20:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589887, 357336, 58047, '<td valign="top">I like the lipstix, but I wonder if the coffee shouldn''t have gone down a little more? Unless she''s only a sipper ? :)</td>', 'I like the lipstix, but I wonder if the coffee shouldn''t have gone down a little more? Unless she''s only a sipper ? :)', '2006-07-05 20:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
