(2590215, 356960, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice capture.  Perhaps a variation in composition may have given this more of an edge.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Nice capture.  Perhaps a variation in composition may have given this more of an edge.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590218, 357066, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good image.  Good story.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.  Toning works well.</td>', '8 - Good image.  Good story.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.  Toning works well.', '2006-07-05 21:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590225, 356206, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good image.  Toning works well.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Good image.  Toning works well.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590230, 356316, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Difficult, but even sharper make this even better - which you''re likely well aware.  Perhaps it is there, just this size doesn''t do it justice.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Difficult, but even sharper make this even better - which you''re likely well aware.  Perhaps it is there, just this size doesn''t do it justice.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590234, 357266, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Good composition.  A bit more texture discernible and the right side not ''cut'', make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Good composition.  A bit more texture discernible and the right side not ''cut'', make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590237, 356892, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice candid/portrait image.  Good character and story.  Difficult to make editing suggestions with this Challenge, but given your apparent skill, I''d say you''re well aware of the work that could be done anyway.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Very nice candid/portrait image.  Good character and story.  Difficult to make editing suggestions with this Challenge, but given your apparent skill, I''d say you''re well aware of the work that could be done anyway.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590241, 356959, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Very good perspective.  Nice and simple.  The building competes with the rainbow in a sense, but does add another element to this shot, if that makes sense.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Very good perspective.  Nice and simple.  The building competes with the rainbow in a sense, but does add another element to this shot, if that makes sense.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590242, 357022, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good.  Like the dof.  Like the framing.  Sharper on the eye with a little more light play on it as well, make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Good.  Like the dof.  Like the framing.  Sharper on the eye with a little more light play on it as well, make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590248, 356226, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  The reflection/glare detracts, but fairly minor and I''m sure you''re well aware that that is about the only real flaw in this shot, perhaps save for the slight ''misalignment'' symmetry-wise, however a very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Very good.  The reflection/glare detracts, but fairly minor and I''m sure you''re well aware that that is about the only real flaw in this shot, perhaps save for the slight ''misalignment'' symmetry-wise, however a very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590251, 357089, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice capture.  Like the composition and framing.  Sharper, which you''re likely well aware, especially on the ''face'' of the .. unusually hairy bee.. make this even better in my opinion.  Be nice if the fore of the seed pods was in focus too, but difficult.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Nice capture.  Like the composition and framing.  Sharper, which you''re likely well aware, especially on the ''face'' of the .. unusually hairy bee.. make this even better in my opinion.  Be nice if the fore of the seed pods was in focus too, but difficult.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590254, 355962, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good capture and candid.  Excellent character capture, as usual - assuming I recognize the photographer''s work.  Just the top, bottom and right side (like to see them dead center), but very minor, of the frame more ''refined'', make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.  That little one on his own... but that''s another image.</td>', '8 - Very good capture and candid.  Excellent character capture, as usual - assuming I recognize the photographer''s work.  Just the top, bottom and right side (like to see them dead center), but very minor, of the frame more ''refined'', make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.  That little one on his own... but that''s another image.', '2006-07-05 21:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590257, 356912, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice capture and good composition.  Difficult, but even more ''pop'', make this even better in my opinion.  Nice simplicity.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Nice capture and good composition.  Difficult, but even more ''pop'', make this even better in my opinion.  Nice simplicity.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590264, 356322, 49773, '<td valign="top">cool title</td>', 'cool title', '2006-07-05 21:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590267, 356874, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good image and good capture.  Really nit-picking, but the fingers on the left not cut and a little more light up onto the eyes (opportunity of course) make this even better in my opinion.  Toning works very well.  So many validations seems a waste of SC time in this Challenge.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Good image and good capture.  Really nit-picking, but the fingers on the left not cut and a little more light up onto the eyes (opportunity of course) make this even better in my opinion.  Toning works very well.  So many validations seems a waste of SC time in this Challenge.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590272, 356349, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture and composition.  Even sharper focus on the ladybug, as seems (although difficult somewhat to discern at this size) to be on the seed head, make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Good capture and composition.  Even sharper focus on the ladybug, as seems (although difficult somewhat to discern at this size) to be on the seed head, make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-05 21:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
