(2593052, 357275, 50695, '<td valign="top">this has one of the best titles ever. suddenly the photo is all about socialization, trying to force children into certain roles... and how this one doesn''t fit... and is just waiting for the moment he can escape. This is achieved metaphorically by the juxtaposition of his wrinkled up, messy blue shirt with the hard smooth blue that surrounds him. the asymmetry adds to the theme as well. for one thing it shows the child is out of balance with the expectations on him. for another it shows us a slot without a child, reminding us that these slots pre-exist the children and the children are forced to fit into them. The child is therefore standing next to his slot as well as being inside of it. We see that the child is everything, and the role is nothing.</td>', 'this has one of the best titles ever. suddenly the photo is all about socialization, trying to force children into certain roles... and how this one doesn''t fit... and is just waiting for the moment he can escape. This is achieved metaphorically by the juxtaposition of his wrinkled up, messy blue shirt with the hard smooth blue that surrounds him. the asymmetry adds to the theme as well. for one thing it shows the child is out of balance with the expectations on him. for another it shows us a slot without a child, reminding us that these slots pre-exist the children and the children are forced to fit into them. The child is therefore standing next to his slot as well as being inside of it. We see that the child is everything, and the role is nothing.', '2006-07-06 12:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593061, 356991, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice dramatic slopes abutting the lake. the geese "pop" nicely.</td>', 'nice dramatic slopes abutting the lake. the geese "pop" nicely.', '2006-07-06 12:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593071, 357113, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s the imperfections that charm me. the "dirty" blue and pink of the sky, the stripes peeking through the silhouette of her pants, and in general the way the foreground is not quite dark enough to be a true silhouette. all of this makes the shot more real to me and therefore more effective. One imagines that this couple does have a sense of reality, that the bond that holds them together now really will last forever.</td>', 'it''s the imperfections that charm me. the "dirty" blue and pink of the sky, the stripes peeking through the silhouette of her pants, and in general the way the foreground is not quite dark enough to be a true silhouette. all of this makes the shot more real to me and therefore more effective. One imagines that this couple does have a sense of reality, that the bond that holds them together now really will last forever.', '2006-07-06 12:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593079, 356542, 50695, '<td valign="top">refreshingly offbeat color for straight from the camera. enjoyed.</td>', 'refreshingly offbeat color for straight from the camera. enjoyed.', '2006-07-06 12:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593088, 356894, 50695, '<td valign="top">the "seagulls" are camera movement... very clever! your camera shake has created a completely flat, abstract piece. a real standout in this challenge. I like the texture of it, and the simplicity of the palate.</td>', 'the "seagulls" are camera movement... very clever! your camera shake has created a completely flat, abstract piece. a real standout in this challenge. I like the texture of it, and the simplicity of the palate.', '2006-07-06 12:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
