(2596565, 357007, 45194, '<td valign="top">I think you have a really good idea to work with here but it didn''t quite come off in this shot. You might want to consider keeping this shot in mind for another contest where you can do more with it.</td>', 'I think you have a really good idea to work with here but it didn''t quite come off in this shot. You might want to consider keeping this shot in mind for another contest where you can do more with it.', '2006-07-07 09:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596568, 356492, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection and subject matter though the well or whatever it is on the left seems out of place in the shot (nothing you could have done about that).  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice reflection and subject matter though the well or whatever it is on the left seems out of place in the shot (nothing you could have done about that).  Nice job.', '2006-07-07 09:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596578, 356419, 45194, '<td valign="top">I like the warm colors and the shot is really intriguing for some reason though I can''t bring myself to score it very high.  I don''t know how to improve it. The couple is a little far away but the balcony is so interesting that I can''t say a closer zoom would help.  Nice entry though.</td>', 'I like the warm colors and the shot is really intriguing for some reason though I can''t bring myself to score it very high.  I don''t know how to improve it. The couple is a little far away but the balcony is so interesting that I can''t say a closer zoom would help.  Nice entry though.', '2006-07-07 09:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596582, 357010, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not bad as far as composition but the sun isn''t working with you here. If you hard sharper, more defined sunlight coming in the shot would be greatly improved.</td>', 'Not bad as far as composition but the sun isn''t working with you here. If you hard sharper, more defined sunlight coming in the shot would be greatly improved.', '2006-07-07 09:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596584, 357105, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and back lighting. It''s a shame she''s sitting in weeds (LOL).</td>', 'Nice composition and back lighting. It''s a shame she''s sitting in weeds (LOL).', '2006-07-07 09:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596589, 357025, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not bad but editing (had it been alowed) could make it better.</td>', 'Not bad but editing (had it been alowed) could make it better.', '2006-07-07 09:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596598, 355962, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and cute models.  The background seems out of place though, especially the upper right corner where I keep trying to figure out where this was taken (distracting me from the subject).  Good timely entry...it''s a shame the background wasn''t better imo.</td>', 'Nice idea and cute models.  The background seems out of place though, especially the upper right corner where I keep trying to figure out where this was taken (distracting me from the subject).  Good timely entry...it''s a shame the background wasn''t better imo.', '2006-07-07 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596602, 357278, 45194, '<td valign="top">Though I''d love to pet the kitty it doesn''t make all that interesting of a photo for me.  Not sure black and white was a good choice for the shot.</td>', 'Though I''d love to pet the kitty it doesn''t make all that interesting of a photo for me.  Not sure black and white was a good choice for the shot.', '2006-07-07 09:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596604, 357000, 45194, '<td valign="top">Has a lot of potential!</td>', 'Has a lot of potential!', '2006-07-07 09:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
