(2596785, 356874, 50695, '<td valign="top">I can see why this was validated. It is out of the camera perfection. You are the bomb. the diagonal of the sill(?) and the diagonals of his cap (and the diagonals of his collar), the distribution of dirt, all aid in conveying the mood of the child''s expression. the blurred background is just more dirt, just more moody brownness. 10</td>', 'I can see why this was validated. It is out of the camera perfection. You are the bomb. the diagonal of the sill(?) and the diagonals of his cap (and the diagonals of his collar), the distribution of dirt, all aid in conveying the mood of the child''s expression. the blurred background is just more dirt, just more moody brownness. 10', '2006-07-07 10:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
