(2596802, 356347, 60905, '<td valign="top">the focus is a bit off on some of this, the detailed focus is in bottom cake, and one rose and half a rose, it would be ideal to have this in very good sharp detail as that is the title! :) nice job juist the same!</td>', 'the focus is a bit off on some of this, the detailed focus is in bottom cake, and one rose and half a rose, it would be ideal to have this in very good sharp detail as that is the title! :) nice job juist the same!', '2006-07-07 10:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
