(2596851, 357116, 60905, '<td valign="top">i think this would be much more apealing if the eyes were more in the photo, this crop is not favorable or framing, the nose should have been left in, or the ears, something to make it more apealing, left as is, is creative and beautiful, but, i think the eyes would make it pop if you had a slightly different angle if choosing this framing for this beautiful subject.</td>', 'i think this would be much more apealing if the eyes were more in the photo, this crop is not favorable or framing, the nose should have been left in, or the ears, something to make it more apealing, left as is, is creative and beautiful, but, i think the eyes would make it pop if you had a slightly different angle if choosing this framing for this beautiful subject.', '2006-07-07 10:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
