(2600560, 356570, 57519, '<td valign="top">This pic made me laugh so hard. Couldn''t wait to vote on it! <br/>To top things, right there is a message stating that this photo has been validated!!! Even funnier! Does that mean it''s real snot?<br/>Again...HAHAHAHAHA!!!<br/>Great job! What an imagination.</td>', 'This pic made me laugh so hard. Couldn''t wait to vote on it! To top things, right there is a message stating that this photo has been validated!!! Even funnier! Does that mean it''s real snot?Again...HAHAHAHAHA!!!Great job! What an imagination.', '2006-07-08 13:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
