(2600578, 356490, 57519, '<td valign="top">Your picture is too small, plus the background isn''t helping. Also, it looks like you used the flash. I think tht''s why the dog looks like it just woke up. Let''s see more pics of this dog in more natural roles... Playing, running, outside. I''m sure you can do it!</td>', 'Your picture is too small, plus the background isn''t helping. Also, it looks like you used the flash. I think tht''s why the dog looks like it just woke up. Let''s see more pics of this dog in more natural roles... Playing, running, outside. I''m sure you can do it!', '2006-07-08 13:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600579, 356526, 57519, '<td valign="top">Well... It''s a ceiling lamp.</td>', 'Well... It''s a ceiling lamp.', '2006-07-08 13:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600580, 357041, 57519, '<td valign="top">The DOF is good, but I don''t like the crop too much. Looks like a pool in the background. Would have made a great composition.</td>', 'The DOF is good, but I don''t like the crop too much. Looks like a pool in the background. Would have made a great composition.', '2006-07-08 13:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600582, 357174, 57519, '<td valign="top">A question comes to mind... Why?<br/>Why so small,<br/>Why is the door opened,<br/>Why did you take this pic, I mean, what is the story you''re telling.</td>', 'A question comes to mind... Why?Why so small,Why is the door opened,Why did you take this pic, I mean, what is the story you''re telling.', '2006-07-08 14:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
