(2600669, 356981, 52439, '<td valign="top">Love the composition here, it works very well. It''s a bit too dark but the ripples make up for that.</td>', 'Love the composition here, it works very well. It''s a bit too dark but the ripples make up for that.', '2006-07-08 14:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600672, 357244, 52439, '<td valign="top">She looks abit unsure, but the photo is brilliant. Brightly lit, but not too bright, nice defining shadows, nice pose.</td>', 'She looks abit unsure, but the photo is brilliant. Brightly lit, but not too bright, nice defining shadows, nice pose.', '2006-07-08 14:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600674, 356793, 52439, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. What a fantastic pose aswell.<br/>Nice composition, framing him with the grass works really well.</td>', 'Lovely shot. What a fantastic pose aswell.Nice composition, framing him with the grass works really well.', '2006-07-08 14:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600675, 356883, 52439, '<td valign="top">Such a crisp, clean shot here. The ''bokeh'' background really gives impact to the perfectly focused subject. The pink is bright enough to give interest to the photo aswell. Really great overall shot here, well done.</td>', 'Such a crisp, clean shot here. The ''bokeh'' background really gives impact to the perfectly focused subject. The pink is bright enough to give interest to the photo aswell. Really great overall shot here, well done.', '2006-07-08 14:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600677, 355962, 52439, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic capture.<br/>These sort of shot really stand out amongst the others.<br/>The expressions on their faces are fantastic, especially the little guy on the right. Nicely lit, etc. Just a great capture.</td>', 'What a fantastic capture.These sort of shot really stand out amongst the others.The expressions on their faces are fantastic, especially the little guy on the right. Nicely lit, etc. Just a great capture.', '2006-07-08 14:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600678, 356369, 52439, '<td valign="top">Lovely, serene image.<br/>Love the colours of the sail aswell, they seem to complement the blue sea and the red tinted sky.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Lovely, serene image.Love the colours of the sail aswell, they seem to complement the blue sea and the red tinted sky.Well done.', '2006-07-08 14:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600683, 356293, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wonder how many people will shout ''tilted horizon'', :P<br/>Personally it doesn''t bother me, i like the waves'' position and the jagged beams peering out into the sea.</td>', 'Wonder how many people will shout ''tilted horizon'', :PPersonally it doesn''t bother me, i like the waves'' position and the jagged beams peering out into the sea.', '2006-07-08 14:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600689, 357066, 52439, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Nice and sharp, and great choice to sepia it.<br/>it really adds to the bored, waiting feeling.<br/>7</td>', 'Lovely shot. Nice and sharp, and great choice to sepia it.it really adds to the bored, waiting feeling.7', '2006-07-08 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
