(2602843, 356669, 29770, '<td valign="top">OK, a nude woman will get usually get good score, but I like this image for more than that.<br/> <br/>I really like the tone of this image.  Her skin tone and the color of the woods and hay all work well together.  The blue blanket was a good choice to set off all of the warm tones.  The lightining is very nice although my only complaint (small) is the shadow that runs across the boot.  I like all the other shadows including those made by the model.  Very nice rustic feel.<br/> <br/>Seriously, I would still like this image even if she left her clothes on.  (Ok, maybe not not quite as much)</td>', 'OK, a nude woman will get usually get good score, but I like this image for more than that. I really like the tone of this image.  Her skin tone and the color of the woods and hay all work well together.  The blue blanket was a good choice to set off all of the warm tones.  The lightining is very nice although my only complaint (small) is the shadow that runs across the boot.  I like all the other shadows including those made by the model.  Very nice rustic feel. Seriously, I would still like this image even if she left her clothes on.  (Ok, maybe not not quite as much)', '2006-07-09 11:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602844, 356369, 29770, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image especially with no PP.  The haze on the hills in the background really help the color of this image.  The sail on the boat adds a touch of color.  Very nice image.</td>', 'This is a very nice image especially with no PP.  The haze on the hills in the background really help the color of this image.  The sail on the boat adds a touch of color.  Very nice image.', '2006-07-09 11:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602852, 356666, 29770, '<td valign="top">I like the pose.  The half smile is interesting.  The lighting is very nice.  The hair color works well with her skin tone.  This one just keeps catching my eye.  Nice.</td>', 'I like the pose.  The half smile is interesting.  The lighting is very nice.  The hair color works well with her skin tone.  This one just keeps catching my eye.  Nice.', '2006-07-09 11:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
