(2602945, 357292, 61318, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful scene, but I''m not crazy about the foreground.  Generally, when you''re able to capture a perfect reflection, that should act as an ideal foreground.  Additional elements aren''t needed, such as the shoreline and rocks you have here.  Having said that, you''ve done a good job with a high contrasty scene.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful scene, but I''m not crazy about the foreground.  Generally, when you''re able to capture a perfect reflection, that should act as an ideal foreground.  Additional elements aren''t needed, such as the shoreline and rocks you have here.  Having said that, you''ve done a good job with a high contrasty scene.', '2006-07-09 12:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
