(2603147, 356497, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Little dark, can''t wait to see this with some processing!  The dark kinda works though...  Maybe you should leave it this way...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice!  Little dark, can''t wait to see this with some processing!  The dark kinda works though...  Maybe you should leave it this way...TC', '2006-07-09 13:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603154, 356866, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice interesting photo...not spectacular...but nice.</td>', 'Nice interesting photo...not spectacular...but nice.', '2006-07-09 13:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603158, 356761, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot straight from the camera.  It''s close to being a really great shot.</td>', 'Not a bad shot straight from the camera.  It''s close to being a really great shot.', '2006-07-09 13:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603160, 357357, 9906, '<td valign="top">I find your choice of shooting this in B/W to be confusing.  This is a very colorful fish...<br/>TC</td>', 'I find your choice of shooting this in B/W to be confusing.  This is a very colorful fish...TC', '2006-07-09 13:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603162, 356348, 45194, '<td valign="top">Very majestic looking shot...almost breathtaking but the lighting isn''t quite interesting enough.  The illuminati proabbly own this building...they own everything else. LOL</td>', 'Very majestic looking shot...almost breathtaking but the lighting isn''t quite interesting enough.  The illuminati proabbly own this building...they own everything else. LOL', '2006-07-09 13:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603163, 356895, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...almost a super shot.  I like the composition and lines of the photo.</td>', 'Nice shot...almost a super shot.  I like the composition and lines of the photo.', '2006-07-09 13:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603165, 357277, 45194, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for my tastes though I''m sure your title indicates that it was dark on purpose. There is a lot of potential in this one but didn''t quite stand out as a great shot for me.</td>', 'A little too dark for my tastes though I''m sure your title indicates that it was dark on purpose. There is a lot of potential in this one but didn''t quite stand out as a great shot for me.', '2006-07-09 13:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603167, 356105, 45194, '<td valign="top">Cute title but the photo leaves a little to be desired. The composition is too centered for me.  Nice DOF though.</td>', 'Cute title but the photo leaves a little to be desired. The composition is too centered for me.  Nice DOF though.', '2006-07-09 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603169, 356276, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of lens.  I think using an interesting lens of filter is what helps out in a contest like straight from the camera.  The photo isn''t anything special without the fisheye lens but with it I''ll give it a 6.</td>', 'Nice choice of lens.  I think using an interesting lens of filter is what helps out in a contest like straight from the camera.  The photo isn''t anything special without the fisheye lens but with it I''ll give it a 6.', '2006-07-09 13:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603171, 356174, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot but the window off on the left side of the frame distracts me.  The lighting looks like it''s in a nightclub but the window makes it look instead like it''s shot in a bedroom and pawned off to look like a night club so it seems a little too forced for me.</td>', 'Not a bad shot but the window off on the left side of the frame distracts me.  The lighting looks like it''s in a nightclub but the window makes it look instead like it''s shot in a bedroom and pawned off to look like a night club so it seems a little too forced for me.', '2006-07-09 13:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603174, 357205, 45194, '<td valign="top">Cute subject matter and good DOF.  Lighting/levels are good straight from the camera.  Technically not a bad photo though it''s not real interesting for me.</td>', 'Cute subject matter and good DOF.  Lighting/levels are good straight from the camera.  Technically not a bad photo though it''s not real interesting for me.', '2006-07-09 13:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603177, 356692, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...a little overprocessed (bright) for me without enough contrast. I realize you couldn''t fix that in software...</td>', 'Nice capture...a little overprocessed (bright) for me without enough contrast. I realize you couldn''t fix that in software...', '2006-07-09 13:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603179, 357020, 45194, '<td valign="top">Very cute capture...great timing.</td>', 'Very cute capture...great timing.', '2006-07-09 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603181, 356232, 45194, '<td valign="top">Wow, oustanding shot....second highest score I''m giving out of 57 votes so far.  I imagine this has a good shot at the top 10 if not the top 5.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow, oustanding shot....second highest score I''m giving out of 57 votes so far.  I imagine this has a good shot at the top 10 if not the top 5.  Great job.', '2006-07-09 13:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603182, 356975, 45194, '<td valign="top">The snake really is your subject but there is so much other stuff going on that your subject becomes lost in the photo (IMO)</td>', 'The snake really is your subject but there is so much other stuff going on that your subject becomes lost in the photo (IMO)', '2006-07-09 13:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603183, 357196, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...the overcast look of the day doesn''t help the shot in my opinion though.</td>', 'Nice shot...the overcast look of the day doesn''t help the shot in my opinion though.', '2006-07-09 13:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603185, 356116, 45194, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great photo. I love it!  Nice choice of effect. I''m assuming this is an effect you can apply in the camera which is a real nice bonus in a striaght from the camera contest.  Definately one of the highest I''ve rated so far - 8</td>', 'Wow! Great photo. I love it!  Nice choice of effect. I''m assuming this is an effect you can apply in the camera which is a real nice bonus in a striaght from the camera contest.  Definately one of the highest I''ve rated so far - 8', '2006-07-09 13:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603187, 357271, 45194, '<td valign="top">Might have been a great shot for bokeh! LOL.  Not bad but doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'Might have been a great shot for bokeh! LOL.  Not bad but doesn''t do anything for me.', '2006-07-09 13:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603190, 356311, 45194, '<td valign="top">Another flower (urgh).  Not being a flower fan, take this with a grain of salt.  The flower isn''t all that interesting and the DOF isn''t helping much.  More vibrant color would have helped but still wouldn''t have made it a great shot in my opinion.</td>', 'Another flower (urgh).  Not being a flower fan, take this with a grain of salt.  The flower isn''t all that interesting and the DOF isn''t helping much.  More vibrant color would have helped but still wouldn''t have made it a great shot in my opinion.', '2006-07-09 13:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603195, 356794, 45194, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute capture but not really a great photo.  I''d keep it around in my personal collection if I were you but not sure I would have entered it into a challenge.  Sorry if that sounds harsh...wasn''t meant to be.</td>', 'It''s a cute capture but not really a great photo.  I''d keep it around in my personal collection if I were you but not sure I would have entered it into a challenge.  Sorry if that sounds harsh...wasn''t meant to be.', '2006-07-09 14:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603198, 356905, 45194, '<td valign="top">Hey look, another flower :(  There are a ton of flower shots in this competition for some reason and I''m so burnt out on them.  Still, having a distaste for flower shots this one is very nice.  Nice image quality, great DOF...a little brightness and contrast would have helped. As much as I hate to do it, I''ll give you a 6 since for flowers, it''s a pretty goon one...</td>', 'Hey look, another flower :(  There are a ton of flower shots in this competition for some reason and I''m so burnt out on them.  Still, having a distaste for flower shots this one is very nice.  Nice image quality, great DOF...a little brightness and contrast would have helped. As much as I hate to do it, I''ll give you a 6 since for flowers, it''s a pretty goon one...', '2006-07-09 14:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603200, 357364, 45194, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect with the light but the composition leaves something to be desired for me.  I might try to fine another angle or something to shoot this place again.</td>', 'Interesting effect with the light but the composition leaves something to be desired for me.  I might try to fine another angle or something to shoot this place again.', '2006-07-09 14:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603203, 356151, 45194, '<td valign="top">Pretty interesting shot though for me there is too much foreground in the picture. A better cropping taking out half of the field below the elk and leaving the sky would have been better I think. I understand you couldn''t do that for this challenge of course.</td>', 'Pretty interesting shot though for me there is too much foreground in the picture. A better cropping taking out half of the field below the elk and leaving the sky would have been better I think. I understand you couldn''t do that for this challenge of course.', '2006-07-09 14:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603204, 355981, 45194, '<td valign="top">Nice quality and composition...the shot would be greatly imporoved had you been alowed to brighten it and maybe saturate it a little with orange and yellow.</td>', 'Nice quality and composition...the shot would be greatly imporoved had you been alowed to brighten it and maybe saturate it a little with orange and yellow.', '2006-07-09 14:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
