(2603208, 356653, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot...I like the composition and the soft image created by shooting through the cloth.  This has a lot of potential that I think you might want to play with for another challenge when you can do more with it.</td>', 'Not a bad shot...I like the composition and the soft image created by shooting through the cloth.  This has a lot of potential that I think you might want to play with for another challenge when you can do more with it.', '2006-07-09 14:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
