(2604633, 357063, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good candid/portrait, as usual - assuming I recognize the photographer''s work.  The crowd in the background oof is good and adds to the ''story'' and character overall.  Difficult, but the eyes even sharper, make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.</td>', '8 - Very good candid/portrait, as usual - assuming I recognize the photographer''s work.  The crowd in the background oof is good and adds to the ''story'' and character overall.  Difficult, but the eyes even sharper, make this even better in my opinion.  Very good ''straight from the camera'' shot.', '2006-07-09 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
