(2604734, 357110, 45475, '<td valign="top">I think there are times when sepia makes sense, but unfortunately, this isn''t one of them [s''okay, you can pound me for that comment later]. But seriously though, the tones don''t help you here. What would have made this image a little more interesting, was if you had gotten down lower so that we couldn''t see the base of the swan''s neck resting on the grass - making it appear as though the swan was really poking up out of the ground. Just a thought. Nice try :)</td>', 'I think there are times when sepia makes sense, but unfortunately, this isn''t one of them [s''okay, you can pound me for that comment later]. But seriously though, the tones don''t help you here. What would have made this image a little more interesting, was if you had gotten down lower so that we couldn''t see the base of the swan''s neck resting on the grass - making it appear as though the swan was really poking up out of the ground. Just a thought. Nice try :)', '2006-07-09 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
