(2606730, 356170, 55956, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club* <br/> <br/>A good image and I think that your final score is well deserved. I think that this is a lucky shot for the horse image painting from the fire but there is even a good technique. good the DOF, the sharpness and even the composition is good. the 400 iso choice allow you have a good detail aven in the dark areas.<br/>Best Regards</td>', '*Critique Club*  A good image and I think that your final score is well deserved. I think that this is a lucky shot for the horse image painting from the fire but there is even a good technique. good the DOF, the sharpness and even the composition is good. the 400 iso choice allow you have a good detail aven in the dark areas.Best Regards', '2006-07-10 11:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
