(2606974, 356929, 4226, '<td valign="top">did you change your username ? Looking at the image, I knew it was you, but then the username looks different, is there something missing ? or I need coffee ?<br/> <br/>congrats on a beautiful capture</td>', 'did you change your username ? Looking at the image, I knew it was you, but then the username looks different, is there something missing ? or I need coffee ? congrats on a beautiful capture', '2006-07-10 12:25:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2606980, 356929, 22781, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gaurawa:</b></div><hr/><i> did you change your username ? Looking at the image, I knew it was you, but then the username looks different, is there something missing ? or I need coffee ?<br/> <br/>congrats on a beautiful capture </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep, I am TAFKAP31 (Philos31 is now Philos, dont you just LOVE it? ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by gaurawa: did you change your username ? Looking at the image, I knew it was you, but then the username looks different, is there something missing ? or I need coffee ? congrats on a beautiful capture   Yep, I am TAFKAP31 (Philos31 is now Philos, dont you just LOVE it? ;)', '2006-07-10 12:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607038, 356874, 15305, '<td valign="top">Highly underrated!!!  A duotone as rich as this straight from the camera deserves at least a top 10!!!</td>', 'Highly underrated!!!  A duotone as rich as this straight from the camera deserves at least a top 10!!!', '2006-07-10 12:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607058, 356667, 15305, '<td valign="top">What!!!!  I thought this was going to be at least within the top 10. Highly underrated, this was one of my 10 scores in this challenge.</td>', 'What!!!!  I thought this was going to be at least within the top 10. Highly underrated, this was one of my 10 scores in this challenge.', '2006-07-10 13:01:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607069, 356840, 15305, '<td valign="top">Another underrated image. It really deserves a higher placement. Congratulations on such a beautiful image.</td>', 'Another underrated image. It really deserves a higher placement. Congratulations on such a beautiful image.', '2006-07-10 13:04:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607146, 356029, 40718, '<td valign="top">Just a few compositional things.  1) It looks a bit too centered.  2) The leaf in the lower right corner is distracting.  3) You may have wanted to monkey with the petals or change your point of view to get more of the heart of the flower.  The lighting is nice for no editing.<br/> <br/>Another point is playing "the game".  If there is a concurrent or has been a recent challenge where there are a zillion entries of one shot (i.e. flowers) your score will suffer from voter fatigue if you use it for another challenge.  That has nothing to do with taking good pictures, but is a bit of advice if scoring well is important.</td>', 'Just a few compositional things.  1) It looks a bit too centered.  2) The leaf in the lower right corner is distracting.  3) You may have wanted to monkey with the petals or change your point of view to get more of the heart of the flower.  The lighting is nice for no editing. Another point is playing "the game".  If there is a concurrent or has been a recent challenge where there are a zillion entries of one shot (i.e. flowers) your score will suffer from voter fatigue if you use it for another challenge.  That has nothing to do with taking good pictures, but is a bit of advice if scoring well is important.', '2006-07-10 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607149, 357292, 16046, '<td valign="top">Sounds like you could have used a right angle viewer for this shot. Then you wouldn''t have to lie on the ground. Congrats on the ribbon, well done.</td>', 'Sounds like you could have used a right angle viewer for this shot. Then you wouldn''t have to lie on the ground. Congrats on the ribbon, well done.', '2006-07-10 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607177, 356968, 11895, '<td valign="top">You nailed the rule of thirds, nice composition.</td>', 'You nailed the rule of thirds, nice composition.', '2006-07-10 13:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607199, 356891, 40718, '<td valign="top">OK, what''s up with not putting the EXIF data down?  Great shot for straight from the camera.  I bet people rebelled a bit against the front hair being fairly soft due to DOF.  The problem, to my eye, is it commands too much of the canvas to be OOF like that.  It also is <i>in front</i> of the face where our brain wants things to be nice and sharp.  Soft hair <i>behind</i> the face does a better job of framing, etc.<br/> <br/>Didn''t you see my thread that cyan is the kiss of death on DPC?  Apparently not...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-10 12:40:37.</i></td>', 'OK, what''s up with not putting the EXIF data down?  Great shot for straight from the camera.  I bet people rebelled a bit against the front hair being fairly soft due to DOF.  The problem, to my eye, is it commands too much of the canvas to be OOF like that.  It also is in front of the face where our brain wants things to be nice and sharp.  Soft hair behind the face does a better job of framing, etc. Didn''t you see my thread that cyan is the kiss of death on DPC?  Apparently not...', '2006-07-10 13:36:28.000000', '2006-07-10 13:40:37.000000', 0),
(2607219, 356456, 11895, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-07-10 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607258, 356652, 48717, '<td valign="top">Gosh - I thought you were stragneghost(john)...he had just won a ribbon with this guy <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=353440" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/513/thumb/353440.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/513/thumb/353440.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/513/thumb/353440.jpg"/></a>, <br/>who looks just like your little bird, and I thought he entered both challenges.  Sorry if I offended you with my comment below.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-10 13:01:09.</i></td>', 'Gosh - I thought you were stragneghost(john)...he had just won a ribbon with this guy , who looks just like your little bird, and I thought he entered both challenges.  Sorry if I offended you with my comment below.', '2006-07-10 13:59:42.000000', '2006-07-10 14:01:09.000000', 0),
(2607297, 356258, 32754, '<td valign="top">this was a very good image..great feel of the Old West.</td>', 'this was a very good image..great feel of the Old West.', '2006-07-10 14:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607299, 356874, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. It transcends the ''family photo album'' tag because of the deft composition and the capture of a great expression. I love the dirt on her hands. The choice of B&amp;W combined with the classic fashion of her rainhat puts this in the realm of timelesness. <br/> <br/> Don''t hesitate to offer up more photos of your kids if they are this well done. <br/> <br/>Sorry I didn''t see this during the voting.</td>', 'This is a great shot. It transcends the ''family photo album'' tag because of the deft composition and the capture of a great expression. I love the dirt on her hands. The choice of B&W combined with the classic fashion of her rainhat puts this in the realm of timelesness.   Don''t hesitate to offer up more photos of your kids if they are this well done.  Sorry I didn''t see this during the voting.', '2006-07-10 14:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607315, 357063, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. I love her shy but quiet confidence. Love the dimple. <br/>I like the somewhat unexpected placement of the subject and the use of the landscape format. It is interesting to see your work without the post-processing that tends to give your photos away. I didn''t see this during the voting.</td>', 'Beautiful capture. I love her shy but quiet confidence. Love the dimple. I like the somewhat unexpected placement of the subject and the use of the landscape format. It is interesting to see your work without the post-processing that tends to give your photos away. I didn''t see this during the voting.', '2006-07-10 14:17:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607346, 357066, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!  What a stunning "straight from the camera" photo!   Why would need even a trace of editing on a perfect photo like this!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!!!  What a stunning "straight from the camera" photo!   Why would need even a trace of editing on a perfect photo like this!!! ', '2006-07-10 14:23:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607354, 357116, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. . . I loved this one!  I love that close-up "in your face" eye-to-eyes with that beautiful animal!! <br/> <br/></td>', 'Awwwww. . . I loved this one!  I love that close-up "in your face" eye-to-eyes with that beautiful animal!!  ', '2006-07-10 14:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607355, 356382, 7322, '<td valign="top">This shot caught my eye because one of the many shots I took for this challenge was of a blue door (in a very different environment). I''m always attracted to brightly colored doors as subject matter. This had a lot of potential for me. I can''t recall what my vote was since for some reason it isn''t showing up as red on the comment page. <br/> <br/>I wish that you had raised the camera just a tad so as to avoid cropping out the top curve of the wall and showing a bit more of the blue pipe (post?). Instead I find myself distracted by that bit of white (a doormat?) at the bottom. There are some kind of blue numbers that catch my eye. <br/> <br/>A scene worth going back to shoot at sundown when the walls would really glow with warmth.</td>', 'This shot caught my eye because one of the many shots I took for this challenge was of a blue door (in a very different environment). I''m always attracted to brightly colored doors as subject matter. This had a lot of potential for me. I can''t recall what my vote was since for some reason it isn''t showing up as red on the comment page.  I wish that you had raised the camera just a tad so as to avoid cropping out the top curve of the wall and showing a bit more of the blue pipe (post?). Instead I find myself distracted by that bit of white (a doormat?) at the bottom. There are some kind of blue numbers that catch my eye.  A scene worth going back to shoot at sundown when the walls would really glow with warmth.', '2006-07-10 14:26:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607358, 356426, 54778, '<td valign="top">Great title... <br/>Though I must confess that I like this pic better then the edited one. Like the much softer light colours</td>', 'Great title... Though I must confess that I like this pic better then the edited one. Like the much softer light colours', '2006-07-10 14:26:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607359, 356940, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  That is majestic!  Great title for this photo.  Amazing!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Whoa!  That is majestic!  Great title for this photo.  Amazing! ', '2006-07-10 14:26:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607365, 356929, 16241, '<td valign="top">another good image hey philos!  congrats</td>', 'another good image hey philos!  congrats', '2006-07-10 14:28:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607375, 356895, 7322, '<td valign="top">I missed this during the voting. Great observation of light and form but it also conveys a timeless mood.</td>', 'I missed this during the voting. Great observation of light and form but it also conveys a timeless mood.', '2006-07-10 14:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607403, 356116, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh way to GOOOO!!!!!!   I was one of your 21 10''s!   It reinstills my faith in the voters to see that others recognized this as a winner.  I wish it was one of the top 3 tho :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh way to GOOOO!!!!!!   I was one of your 21 10''s!   It reinstills my faith in the voters to see that others recognized this as a winner.  I wish it was one of the top 3 tho :) ', '2006-07-10 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607406, 357275, 7322, '<td valign="top">How did this wind up so low? It got an 8 from me. I loved the simplicity of the background and the way his gorgeous eyes seem to absorb the blue of the background and his shirt. I like the somewhat, shy, slumpy pose which really captures the awkwardness of the age (my guess between 10-13?). The slight distortion at the corner of the frame echoes the awkwardness (in a good way). I didn''t quite get the title though.</td>', 'How did this wind up so low? It got an 8 from me. I loved the simplicity of the background and the way his gorgeous eyes seem to absorb the blue of the background and his shirt. I like the somewhat, shy, slumpy pose which really captures the awkwardness of the age (my guess between 10-13?). The slight distortion at the corner of the frame echoes the awkwardness (in a good way). I didn''t quite get the title though.', '2006-07-10 14:40:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607407, 356378, 54778, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to make tomatoes (ugh..) pretty :)<br/>Didn''t think you could do that.<br/>And did it taste good ;P<br/></td>', 'You''ve managed to make tomatoes (ugh..) pretty :)Didn''t think you could do that.And did it taste good ;P', '2006-07-10 14:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607411, 357292, 24454, '<td valign="top">I am so glad this ribboned!   I''m glad all that trouble and discomfort you went through was so well worth it!  And YES. ..you should definitely enter more challenges!  You live in a beautiful part of the world, and I bet you would have lots of ribbons just for the taking :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am so glad this ribboned!   I''m glad all that trouble and discomfort you went through was so well worth it!  And YES. ..you should definitely enter more challenges!  You live in a beautiful part of the world, and I bet you would have lots of ribbons just for the taking :) ', '2006-07-10 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607415, 357266, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  AMAZING to get this kind of contrast and vibrancy straight from the camera!  A stunning photo very deserving of a ribbon!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  AMAZING to get this kind of contrast and vibrancy straight from the camera!  A stunning photo very deserving of a ribbon! ', '2006-07-10 14:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607420, 356174, 7322, '<td valign="top">This got a 7 from me. It deserved to place much higher.</td>', 'This got a 7 from me. It deserved to place much higher.', '2006-07-10 14:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607430, 357187, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo Harvey!  Both your versions are truly wonderful!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awesome photo Harvey!  Both your versions are truly wonderful! ', '2006-07-10 14:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607440, 355962, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Lesley!  Another gallery photo!   This photo makes me smile SO MUCH!!!!   I LOVE IT!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Lesley!  Another gallery photo!   This photo makes me smile SO MUCH!!!!   I LOVE IT!!! ', '2006-07-10 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607443, 356671, 32997, '<td valign="top">Wow..that is pretty harsh voting. Ok I didn''t vote at all...<br/>I think the subject is well captured and quite interesting. Getting a chance to look at it, I think the right side of the frame is hurting you...it draws the eyes away, and emphasizes the tilt in the tree. Now this is straight out of camera, so I think it would be nice to see a tighter cropped version, that is straightened.<br/>A much better shot than your score indicates.</td>', 'Wow..that is pretty harsh voting. Ok I didn''t vote at all...I think the subject is well captured and quite interesting. Getting a chance to look at it, I think the right side of the frame is hurting you...it draws the eyes away, and emphasizes the tilt in the tree. Now this is straight out of camera, so I think it would be nice to see a tighter cropped version, that is straightened.A much better shot than your score indicates.', '2006-07-10 14:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607449, 356389, 11895, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, should have finished higher.</td>', 'Very nice capture, should have finished higher.', '2006-07-10 14:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607454, 357010, 32997, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot..I think you got hit by your foacus point..that tree in the foreground just dominates the shot, and unfortunately isn''t in focus.<br/>lighting is very nice.</td>', 'this is a nice shot..I think you got hit by your foacus point..that tree in the foreground just dominates the shot, and unfortunately isn''t in focus.lighting is very nice.', '2006-07-10 14:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607458, 356246, 11895, '<td valign="top">beautiful color and sharpness, WTG jb</td>', 'beautiful color and sharpness, WTG jb', '2006-07-10 14:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607462, 356916, 24454, '<td valign="top">No. . .THIS ONE is wayyyyyyyy underrated.  I just love this photo!  <br/> <br/>It was easy one of the best in the challenge!<br/> <br/></td>', 'No. . .THIS ONE is wayyyyyyyy underrated.  I just love this photo!   It was easy one of the best in the challenge! ', '2006-07-10 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607473, 356626, 32997, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what the voters saw here...this is a sweet shot...your subject is caught on an interesting angle..<br/>the shadows do not distract or remove any key info..so what was expected..I don''t know...I guess people like bright colours with their baby shots...emotionally it makes them feel more positive, not more critically aware..<br/>Congrats to you on your new grandson!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-10 13:59:33.</i></td>', 'I am not sure what the voters saw here...this is a sweet shot...your subject is caught on an interesting angle..the shadows do not distract or remove any key info..so what was expected..I don''t know...I guess people like bright colours with their baby shots...emotionally it makes them feel more positive, not more critically aware..Congrats to you on your new grandson!', '2006-07-10 14:58:50.000000', '2006-07-10 14:59:33.000000', 0),
(2607484, 356496, 32997, '<td valign="top">effectively moody portrait...</td>', 'effectively moody portrait...', '2006-07-10 15:03:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607501, 357315, 32997, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the concept that the water is distracting when the subject is a girl playing in a sprinkler...<br/>The girl is distracting... :o<br/>I think this shot deserved a much higher score (but I didn''t vote so shoot me).</td>', 'I don''t understand the concept that the water is distracting when the subject is a girl playing in a sprinkler...The girl is distracting... :oI think this shot deserved a much higher score (but I didn''t vote so shoot me).', '2006-07-10 15:09:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607507, 356828, 11895, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I like the colors, the composition, and the lovely bokehed background.</td>', 'Excellent, I like the colors, the composition, and the lovely bokehed background.', '2006-07-10 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607508, 357275, 32997, '<td valign="top">I love the distortion..really adds to the tension..</td>', 'I love the distortion..really adds to the tension..', '2006-07-10 15:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607514, 356443, 32997, '<td valign="top">The really stands out in this challenge. The soft focus in contadiction with the bars. The eyes and mouth looking like the cat is really uncomfortable, wanting to be out...almost annoyed. And behing blackness, no hope. Well done.</td>', 'The really stands out in this challenge. The soft focus in contadiction with the bars. The eyes and mouth looking like the cat is really uncomfortable, wanting to be out...almost annoyed. And behing blackness, no hope. Well done.', '2006-07-10 15:15:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2607522, 356806, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo.   I''m disappointed that it didn''t finish higher.  It deserves to be!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really love this photo.   I''m disappointed that it didn''t finish higher.  It deserves to be! ', '2006-07-10 15:17:01.000000', NULL, 0),
