(2608747, 357116, 37719, '<td valign="top">As a horse lover, this is excellent.  The kind of portrait you don''t see much of with horses.  The closeness lets you focus on the eyes and also lets the strong bone and vein lines really add character and strength to the shot.  The colors are beautiful - nice tones and contrasts.  Nice job Jimmy! I love it!</td>', 'As a horse lover, this is excellent.  The kind of portrait you don''t see much of with horses.  The closeness lets you focus on the eyes and also lets the strong bone and vein lines really add character and strength to the shot.  The colors are beautiful - nice tones and contrasts.  Nice job Jimmy! I love it!', '2006-07-10 21:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2608858, 357292, 45826, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Philos:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations, to be honnest, I like this one better then the blue ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah well I like that guy that had the blue ribbon better! LOL</td>', 'Originally posted by Philos: Congratulations, to be honnest, I like this one better then the blue ribbon.   Yeah well I like that guy that had the blue ribbon better! LOL', '2006-07-10 22:18:45.000000', NULL, 0),
