(2608926, 357116, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Jimmy, my favorite subject.  My only concern was the almost oversharpened look of the forelock, eyelashes and face.  As this was a straight out of the camera challenge I assume that you used in camera sharpening?<br/> <br/>Looking at your edited version in a recent post in the forums I also like the second edit, close crop of one eye.<br/> <br/>Edit to add : I also love the fly on the cheek LOL<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-10 21:40:20.</i></td>', 'Nice shot Jimmy, my favorite subject.  My only concern was the almost oversharpened look of the forelock, eyelashes and face.  As this was a straight out of the camera challenge I assume that you used in camera sharpening? Looking at your edited version in a recent post in the forums I also like the second edit, close crop of one eye. Edit to add : I also love the fly on the cheek LOL', '2006-07-10 22:39:48.000000', '2006-07-10 22:40:20.000000', 0),
