(2621131, 357070, 7969, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the CC.  This is a good use of DOF and nice subject.  I really like the light on the back wings tho I do wish the eyes were a bit clearer/sharper and that the foreground wing was sharp.  Tho this is a unique take.  I think you overall have a nice image, I think it would be stunning if the dragon was facing the viewer. <br/> <br/>Nice work keep it up!<br/>Lynn</td>', 'Greetings from the CC.  This is a good use of DOF and nice subject.  I really like the light on the back wings tho I do wish the eyes were a bit clearer/sharper and that the foreground wing was sharp.  Tho this is a unique take.  I think you overall have a nice image, I think it would be stunning if the dragon was facing the viewer.  Nice work keep it up!Lynn', '2006-07-14 01:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
